    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know if \"finding a way\" even works. i feel like the damage is already done and it's permanent. it's like i'm mourning someone who's still alive, but it's actually me. how am i supposed to just move on when every single person i know has decided i'm not worth even talking to? everything just feels so empty and heavy.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
